        "visibility": "internal",
        "coverage": "native_imported",
        "excerpt": {
          "text": "The cluster serving South America subscriptions is in a degraded state following a recent infrastructure migration. Recurring billing jobs are failing intermittently, causing subscription renewals to stall for merchants whose end customers are in Brazil.\n\nImmediate action: Reroute South America subscription processing traffic to US-East clusters while the root cause is investigated in parallel.\n\nBackground:\nPost-migration health checks passed but latent instability in the cluster's job scheduler became apparent under production load. The scheduler is dropping renewal jobs silently — no retries are queued, no failure webhooks are emitted. Manual charge API calls succeed, confirming the issue is isolated to the scheduled billing layer, not the payment processing path.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n– South America subscription traffic successfully rerouted to US-East clusters with no data loss\n– Subscription renewal jobs resume processing with <2% failure rate\n– All subscriptions that missed their renewal window are automatically retried with no merchant intervention required\n– Webhook delivery resumes for subscription.renewed, invoice.paid, and payment_intent.succeeded\n– No double-billing occurs as a result of the rerouting\n– Root cause documented; post-mortem scheduled",
          "field_path": "original_record.description",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 1280,
          "units": "unicode_code_points"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "evidence-tkt-124",
        "entity_id": "entity-tkt-124",
        "source_ref": {
          "dataset_id": "enterprise-bench/maple-payments",
          "path": "crm_json_data/tickets.json",
          "record_id": "TKT-124",
          "content_sha256": "335720bd7dfcadb3c9153ca0d7c276ec414abbd57307fa3040363cba9a7f9575"
        },
        "original_event_at": "2026-03-20T17:15:00Z",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-10-10T22:54:31.185524+00:00",
        "source_owner": {
          "person_id": null,
          "name": null,
          "resolution": "missing"
        },
        "visibility": "internal",
        "coverage": "native_imported",
        "excerpt": {
          "text": "We are seeing recurring billing failures for our Brazil-based end customers. Subscriptions are moving to past_due on their renewal date with no charge attempted and no retry queued. Dunning is enabled and payment methods are valid — manual charges via the API succeed on the same customers. Our US and EU subscribers are unaffected. This is causing escalations from our Brazilian clients and real churn risk. Please treat this as highest priority.",
          "field_path": "original_record.description",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 447,
          "units": "unicode_code_points"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "evidence-tkt-125",
        "entity_id": "entity-tkt-125",
        "source_ref": {
          "dataset_id": "enterprise-bench/maple-payments",
          "path": "crm_json_data/tickets.json",
          "record_id": "TKT-125",
          "content_sha256": "baa315884bc075e1e61c37f469e9f964600138ba5239fbb508378441bedce1e9"
        },
        "original_event_at": "2026-03-21T09:30:00Z",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-10-10T22:54:31.185524+00:00",
        "source_owner": {
          "person_id": null,
          "name": null,
          "resolution": "missing"
        },
        "visibility": "internal",
        "coverage": "native_imported",
        "excerpt": {
          "text": "Recurring subscription billing has completely stopped for our Brazil-region customers. Subscriptions reach their renewal date, move to past_due, and no payment attempt is made — no failure webhooks are firing either. Manual API charges on the same customers succeed. Merchants in all other regions are renewing normally. We have hundreds of affected subscriptions and are already receiving escalations from our own merchants. We need an ETA and confirmation that affected subscriptions will be retried automatically once resolved.",
          "field_path": "original_record.description",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 530,
          "units": "unicode_code_points"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "evidence-tkt-126",
        "entity_id": "entity-tkt-126",
        "source_ref": {
          "dataset_id": "enterprise-bench/maple-payments",
          "path": "crm_json_data/tickets.json",
          "record_id": "TKT-126",
          "content_sha256": "48bb804398bb6002b1b826fb2d0a12e7f6e98a5560d2be9cb72822f98373f7b5"
